        "original_id": "3d2cc94e-e542-5659-9ed1-ed86c3da8308",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John of Denmark, Frederick I of Denmark\n- Places: Schleswig, Holstein, Dithmarschen, North Sea, Denmark, Norway\n- Roles: Co-dukes of Schleswig and Holstein, King of Denmark, elected King of Norway\n- Concepts: Peasants' republic\n\nFacts:\n- John of Denmark and his brother Frederick I of Denmark were co-dukes of Schleswig and Holstein.\n- The peasantry of Dithmarschen had established a peasants' republic on the coast of the North Sea.\n- John of Denmark and Frederick I of Denmark attempted to subdue the peasantry of Dithmarschen.\n- Frederick I of Denmark was styled \"King of Denmark, the Vends and the Goths, elected King of Norway\".",
